WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Boss, please listen to my explanation

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,600
That's not what happened

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,080
I was distracted by something just now

4
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,280
Yes, possessed by a ghost

5
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:09,500
The boss who didn’t mean it now

6
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,180
Is there anything else you have to argue with? I'll pay you.

7
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:13,140
I lose money

8
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,540
All gold boxes are given to you

9
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,420
These can definitely buy all the food here

10
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,780
I'll pay you all

11
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:22,680
You took all the money

12
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,000
Put me down quickly

13
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,840
I'll pretend nothing happened today

14
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,640
I'll make sure to give you good publicity when I get back to the base.

15
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:31,520
When the time comes when the customers are gone, let’s clean up and shut up the system.

16
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:32,840
take him to the hall

17
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,910
Feng Tianxi?

18
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:46,990
Feng Tianxi offended his boss
